{"unit_id":"activeing123__dsh-forge#card-zh","repo":"activeing123/dsh-forge","commit":"29f17b39e8d179bb19dd0875e8c38bd55bca80b8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-forge（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把重复成功的会话流程整理成可复用技能。它监听会话事件，收集用户意图和工具调用，并在重复任务成功后调用宿主 LLM 生成技能说明与步骤，写入 SKILL.md 并注册到技能目录。用户也可以从工具卡片面板或 forge_skill 工具手动生成技能，查看会话轨迹和已生成项目。适合希望在 DSH 中复用常见任务流程的用户。需要宿主提供 LLM、文件系统和技能注册服务，可选配置技能文件输出目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:67","lib/index.js:101","lib/index.js:135","lib/index.js:162","lib/client.js:18"]}
{"unit_id":"activeing123__dsh-forge#card-en","repo":"activeing123/dsh-forge","commit":"29f17b39e8d179bb19dd0875e8c38bd55bca80b8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-forge turns repeated successful DSH sessions into reusable skills. It tracks session intents and tool calls, asks the host LLM to write steps, saves SKILL.md, and registers it for later use. Users can trigger forging from a tool or Web panel and view traces.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:67","lib/index.js:101","lib/index.js:135","lib/index.js:162","lib/client.js:18"]}
