{"unit_id":"activeing123__dsh-forge#feature-1","repo":"activeing123/dsh-forge","commit":"29f17b39e8d179bb19dd0875e8c38bd55bca80b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-forge 的功能「重复任务自动锻造」：插件记录用户意图、工具调用和回合完成状态；相同首个意图在至少两个已完成会话中重复，且当前会话至少有三次工具调用时，会自动请求生成可复用技能。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:67","lib/index.js:101","lib/index.js:110"]}
{"unit_id":"activeing123__dsh-forge#feature-2","repo":"activeing123/dsh-forge","commit":"29f17b39e8d179bb19dd0875e8c38bd55bca80b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-forge 的功能「手动生成技能」：用户可调用 forge_skill 工具或在 Web 工具卡片面板按锻造按钮，选择最近有工具调用的会话并生成技能内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:180","lib/index.js:208","lib/client.js:33"]}
{"unit_id":"activeing123__dsh-forge#feature-3","repo":"activeing123/dsh-forge","commit":"29f17b39e8d179bb19dd0875e8c38bd55bca80b8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-forge 的功能「保存并注册技能」：生成的技能以带 frontmatter 的 SKILL.md 写入配置目录，并通过宿主技能服务注册，供后续会话加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:157","lib/index.js:162","lib/index.js:165","lib/index.js:173"]}
{"unit_id":"activeing123__dsh-forge#caveat-1","repo":"activeing123/dsh-forge","commit":"29f17b39e8d179bb19dd0875e8c38bd55bca80b8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-forge 使用前须知：生成技能时会把会话意图和最多 40 条工具调用名称及参数交给宿主 LLM；生成的 SKILL.md 会写入会话工作区的技能目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:139","lib/index.js:141","lib/index.js:144","lib/index.js:165","lib/index.js:168"]}
